Sorry, I _knew_ I hadn't written that clearly enough.

What I meant to confess not knowing was whether a hostile
Elbereth-respecting monster would attack an Elberethed
square on which a pet was standing.

To protect stashes from pets, I put a cursed item on
top of the stack on such a square to discourage pets from
stepping there, and to have something on top the pet will
_not_ pick up, since IIUC, pets can only pick up the top
item in a stack. That keeps my container from being
dragged off by one of my pets.

